# Everything under platform/ is a VENDORED copy of a bundle project42-platform
# owns, hash-locked in themes.lock.json. Git must hand it back byte for byte on
# every checkout, so line-ending normalisation is switched off here: with
# core.autocrlf=true a Windows clone would rewrite every LF, the sha256 in the
# lock would stop matching, and validate-matrix.mjs would report a tampered
# platform theme on a checkout nobody had touched.
* -text
